        <div class="case-title">Colonial Pipeline ransomware attack (2021)</div>
        <div class="case-body">DarkSide ransomware group shut down the largest US fuel pipeline for 6 days, causing fuel
          shortages across the southeast. Colonial paid $4.4M in Bitcoin (the FBI later recovered $2.3M). Root cause: a
          single compromised VPN password with no MFA enabled.</div>
