      <div class="section-title">Social engineering — hacking humans</div>
      <div class="section-intro">The weakest link in any security system is the human being. Social engineering exploits
        psychology — trust, fear, urgency, and authority — rather than technical vulnerabilities. No firewall can block
        a person being tricked.</div>

